y V model is called Yukino and I would like to have a special art due to a new item that will drop from Apex soon. The character I want to imitate is Loba from Apex. You can keep Yukino's hair color the same and only make changes to her hair style and pose.\n\nIn my reference, I have a Yukino picture and Loba outfit and pose that I wanted. \n\nMy request: Yukino in Loba pose\nHair color: Blonde\nHair style: Braided like Loba\nOutfit: Loba outfit (if the design is too difficult, you can minimize the accessories)\nPose: Holding Loba's Black Market cane and a pistol\nCat can be excluded.\n\nI hope you can accept this request! Thank you so much!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lgVyOJ03yh0jc3Mrcc7QsgBECHcl8CMi?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiroto98765/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2699179, "client_id": 832994, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c486097d/uploads/origins/ff722aac-6418-470f-af9c-dc74df73348f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ea97c0727814e62e179b820dc497f82", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c486097d/uploads/origins/ff722aac-6418-470f-af9c-dc74df73348f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ea97c0727814e62e179b820dc497f82, https://si.imgix.net/c486097d/uploads/origins/ff722aac-6418-470f-af9c-dc74df73348f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=359369e5af71491b48f7d5b836421dcc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c486097d/uploads/origins/ff722aac-6418-470f-af9c-dc74df73348f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b09d602dde43901bf03855b412041a0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c486097d/uploads/origins/ff722aac-6418-470f-af