26033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=530c1f84b26407d0be5bb98ef7aa920e, https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36f41e42c85c65a8bd5d1c0943fea921 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e056e351be19dd95536a74119d55a4d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6264e32ebf024d7fd49c47b6fd3cb432", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6264e32ebf024d7fd49c47b6fd3cb432, https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59980b456f408a36d505a2d1d9fb4556 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e5ece98/uploads/origins/9b526033-ac98-4438-aa83-be5c71ee516f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2adebc31eb7e8b5e50786ec403c6c8a0 3x"}, "body": "Hi Hiroto, nice to meet you.\n\nI am contacting you because I would like to request an illustration to be used as a thumbnail for my FPS game called Valorant.\n\nThe illustration is as follows\n\n I am holding an item of the character Deadlock (unfortunately I don't have a picture of it, so here is the official video:https://youtu.be/SsbI3yA1lwA)\n Wearing Deadlock's outfit.\n(If you can see the tools and the costume, it's OK.)\n PNG (no scenery)\n Pose: Image of standing pose and facial expression:https://twitter.com/yakitomahawk/status/1544954488812888064?s=46&t=8b3R67GKPzIZIx2rwqnFKQ (This is just an image, so please leave it to us how you actually hold the tools. (This is just an image, so we will leave it up to you how you actually hold the tools. The general idea is that he is standing in a slightly arrogant manner)\n\nSince this is for a thumbnail, we will make sure to include Hiroto's Twitter and other information in the summary section of the frame.\n\n  Thank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nClonty Hill\n\nhttps://twitter.com/kurontihr/status/1609630225696194561?s=46&t=8b3R67GKPzIZIx2rwqnFKQ", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiroto98765/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2699179, "client_id": 2433459, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa9942e7a1cbe942f2ce23d1fc4ef2ab", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa9942e7a1cbe942f2ce23d1fc4ef2ab, https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27f722255c99e88503f6d9cc155ba809 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c041857ca18080125fe13f8d3e878bc 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33852f60a01581eb469d93bda78e113e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33852f60a01581eb469d93bda78e113e, https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7db07b38d8b50ce3d7cf039a1d23e1f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0887f0ca/uploads/origins/1a78d2d6-1bfe-478d-baf8-3cfe9cc54d9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6fdf8640da88114386c7b76929c5956a 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nMy name is Mena Noshime, an ice witch VTuber.\n I like the cool design of your illustration, Hiroto@skeb half-price, so I wanted to make a request for you to draw it for me.\n\nAbout the illustration\nI would like you to draw an illustration of me.\nI will leave the composition to you.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw my head, hair, hands, etc. in a way that they are not cut off.\n\n\u25bcReference\nI will attach a 3-sided drawing and links to Twitter and YouTube.\n\nThree-sided drawing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PeUeYH1-W4-o0ujFt1bzZUPlxjZ6jWKN?usp=sharing\n\nTwitter\nhttps://twitter.com/noshime_mena\n\nYouTube\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@noshime_mena\n\nDelivery Method\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the background, the person, and the signature, and if you could also provide a transparent version of the image.\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data.\n\nIntended use\nWe would like to use it for distribution activities such as icons and headers for social networking sites like Twitter, Ohatsui, Fanbox, YouTube thumbnails, posters, etc.\nWe would appreciate it if you could write on a separate layer whether commercial use (distribution, cheki, neppuri, etc.) is also possible.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, but thank you in advance.", "nc": 16, "word_count"